    "body": "@jonathantneal Hello, Jonathan.\r\n\r\n> could `_` and `data` be synonymous?\r\n\r\nWhile such synonymization might sound good at first glance, this would probably lead to confusion and complexity in terms of e.&thinsp;g. priority when both `_` and `data-` (e.g. `_foo` and `data-foo`) attributes are set. That’s why I intentionally explicitly pointed out that they should not affect each other in any way.",
